@bank all
// SW2 (writer), patch 0.92.6 item 10: the odd jobs around the ship (FX20's ODD_ROWS, behind ODD_ON; ids and titles
// from plans/fx20-odd-jobs.md on claude/p926-fx20). Read by fixWord as fix.oj-<id>.sign|done, as FX10's small repairs
// in fixes.lines. TEXTS, said by nobody. sign: what you notice when you arrive. done: what's different now. The
// titles are in FX20's table; each job's title is in the comment above its lines. One line per key. No bridge.

// ---- Deck 2: the senior corridor, washroom, observatory, chart room
// Clean the lift lobby vent
== fix.oj-d2lobby-vent.sign
- A grey fur of dust has grown across the lobby vent's slats.
== fix.oj-d2lobby-vent.done
- Clean slats. The air comes through cool.
// Tighten a wobbly lobby bench
== fix.oj-d2lobby-bench.sign
- The lobby bench tips forward whenever someone sits on the end.
== fix.oj-d2lobby-bench.done
- Sit on either end. It doesn't budge.
// Polish the deck sign by the lift
== fix.oj-d2lobby-sign.sign
- The deck sign by the lift is dull with fingerprints.
== fix.oj-d2lobby-sign.done
- The sign shines. You can see your face in the number.
// Replace a buzzing lobby light
== fix.oj-d2lobby-light.sign
- One lobby light buzzes like a trapped fly and dims every few seconds.
== fix.oj-d2lobby-light.done
- Quiet, even light. The buzzing's gone.
// Oil a squeaky door in the senior corridor
== fix.oj-d2corr-hinge.sign
- A door in the senior corridor squeals every time it opens.
== fix.oj-d2corr-hinge.done
- It swings shut without a sound. Someone will be grateful.
// Refit a loose wall panel
== fix.oj-d2corr-panel.sign
- A wall panel in the corridor rattles when anyone walks past.
== fix.oj-d2corr-panel.done
- Flush and firm. Not a rattle.
// Clear a slow drain in the washroom
== fix.oj-d2wc-drain.sign
- The washroom basin drains slowly, with a sulky gurgle.
== fix.oj-d2wc-drain.done
- The water swirls straight down.
// Clean the washroom extractor grille
== fix.oj-d2wc-vent.sign
- The extractor grille hums, but the mirror stays fogged.
== fix.oj-d2wc-vent.done
- The grille pulls properly. The mirror clears in seconds.
// Unstick a window blind in the observatory
== fix.oj-d2obs-blind.sign
- An observatory blind is stuck half down across the stars.
== fix.oj-d2obs-blind.done
- It rolls right up. Nothing between you and the view.
// Free a sticky locker latch
== fix.oj-d2chart-latch.sign
- A chart locker latch won't let go without a hard yank.
== fix.oj-d2chart-latch.done
- One light push and it clicks open.
// Clean a dusty vent in the chart room
== fix.oj-d2chart-vent.sign
- Dust from the chart room vent keeps settling on the big table.
== fix.oj-d2chart-vent.done
- The vent's clean. Mori's charts will stay dust-free.
// ---- Deck 3: Commons
// Clean the lift plaza floor vent
== fix.oj-d3plaza-vent.sign
- Crumbs and fluff have filled the lift plaza floor vent.
== fix.oj-d3plaza-vent.done
- The floor vent breathes again.
// Tighten a rocking plaza bench
== fix.oj-d3plaza-bench.sign
- A plaza bench rocks from side to side like a boat.
== fix.oj-d3plaza-bench.done
- Steady. You could balance a cup on it.
// Scrape gum off a bench
== fix.oj-d3plaza-gum.sign
- Someone has left a grey blob of gum under the bench edge.
== fix.oj-d3plaza-gum.done
- Gone. Nobody will ever know who.
// Polish the lift call plate
== fix.oj-d3plaza-sign.sign
- The lift call plate is smeared from a hundred thumbs.
== fix.oj-d3plaza-sign.done
- The plate gleams. The arrows look brand new.
// Stick down a curling floor mat
== fix.oj-d3plaza-mat.sign
- The corner of the plaza floor mat curls up, waiting to trip someone.
== fix.oj-d3plaza-mat.done
- Flat to the floor, edge to edge.
// Clean a promenade vent
== fix.oj-d3prom-vent.sign
- A promenade vent whistles a thin, high note.
== fix.oj-d3prom-vent.done
- The whistle's gone. Just the soft rush of air.
// Tighten a loose handrail
== fix.oj-d3prom-rail.sign
- The handrail shifts in its bracket when you lean on it.
== fix.oj-d3prom-rail.done
- Solid as the deck. Lean away.
// Unclog a planter drip line
== fix.oj-d3prom-planter.sign
- One promenade planter's soil is bone dry; its drip line is blocked.
== fix.oj-d3prom-planter.done
- The drip line ticks again. The plants will perk up by lunch.
// Clean the smudged view glass
== fix.oj-d3prom-glass.sign
- The view glass is smudged with nose prints from keen stargazers.
== fix.oj-d3prom-glass.done
- Clear glass. The stars look sharper.
// Replace a flickering path light
== fix.oj-d3prom-light.sign
- A path light flickers on and off along the promenade floor.
== fix.oj-d3prom-light.done
- A steady glow along the path.
// Clean a lounge ceiling vent
== fix.oj-d3lounge-vent.sign
- The lounge ceiling vent ticks, like a clock that's lost count.
== fix.oj-d3lounge-vent.done
- Quiet. The lounge is calm again.
// Fix a sagging sofa leg
== fix.oj-d3lounge-sofa.sign
- One end of a lounge sofa sinks lower than the other.
== fix.oj-d3lounge-sofa.done
- Level cushions. Nobody slides off now.
// Level a wobbly lounge table
== fix.oj-d3lounge-table.sign
- A lounge table rocks whenever anyone puts a drink down.
== fix.oj-d3lounge-table.done
- Rock steady. No more saucers of spilt tea.
// Unstick a window blind in the lounge
== fix.oj-d3lounge-blind.sign
- A lounge blind is jammed at a tilt across the curved windows.
== fix.oj-d3lounge-blind.done
- Smooth up, smooth down. The view's all yours.
// Replace a lounge reading lamp
== fix.oj-d3lounge-lamp.sign
- The reading lamp by the armchairs is dead.
== fix.oj-d3lounge-lamp.done
- A warm circle of light. Somebody will read there tonight.
// Reset a dead lounge socket
== fix.oj-d3lounge-socket.sign
- A lounge socket gives nothing, whatever is plugged in.
== fix.oj-d3lounge-socket.done
- A green light. Power's back.
// Level a wobbly mess table
== fix.oj-d3mess-table.sign
- A mess table see-saws whenever someone leans on their elbows.
== fix.oj-d3mess-table.done
- Firm and flat. Elbows welcome.
// Tighten a squeaky mess chair
== fix.oj-d3mess-chair.sign
- A mess chair squeaks like a mouse whenever anyone sits.
== fix.oj-d3mess-chair.done
- Silent. Not a peep from it at dinner now.
// Clean a greasy mess hall vent
== fix.oj-d3mess-vent.sign
- The mess hall vent is coated with a film of kitchen grease.
== fix.oj-d3mess-vent.done
- The slats are clean. The mess smells only of dinner now.
// Unjam the tray rack runner
== fix.oj-d3mess-tray.sign
- The tray rack runner sticks halfway, and the trays pile up.
== fix.oj-d3mess-tray.done
- Trays glide in and out.
// Scrape a sticky patch off the floor
== fix.oj-d3mess-floor.sign
- A sticky patch by the servery grabs at every shoe.
== fix.oj-d3mess-floor.done
- Clean floor. No more squelch.
// Replace a mess hall downlight
== fix.oj-d3mess-light.sign
- One downlight over the long tables has gone out.
== fix.oj-d3mess-light.done
- Every table's lit again.
// Degrease the galley hood filters
== fix.oj-d3galley-hood.sign
- The galley hood filters are thick with grease. Brennan has left a pointed note.
== fix.oj-d3galley-hood.done
- The filters shine. The steam goes straight up and out.
// Free a jammed utensil drawer
== fix.oj-d3galley-drawer.sign
- The utensil drawer jams on a ladle every time it opens.
== fix.oj-d3galley-drawer.done
- It slides open first go. The ladle's behaving.
// Clear the galley floor drain
== fix.oj-d3galley-drain.sign
- Water pools round the galley floor drain after every wipe-down.
== fix.oj-d3galley-drain.done
- The floor drains dry in seconds.
// Oil a squeaky cupboard hinge
== fix.oj-d3galley-hinge.sign
- A galley cupboard hinge creaks loud enough to hear over the pans.
== fix.oj-d3galley-hinge.done
- Not a creak. The pans have the room to themselves.
// Refit the cold store door seal
== fix.oj-d3cold-seal.sign
- The cold store door seal has come away at one corner. You can feel the chill leak out.
== fix.oj-d3cold-seal.done
- Sealed all round. The cold stays where it belongs. Brennan will be pleased.
// Fix a sagging shop shelf
== fix.oj-d3store-shelf.sign
- A shelf in the crew store sags in the middle under the biscuit tins.
== fix.oj-d3store-shelf.done
- Straight and strong. The biscuits are safe.
// Oil the sticking shop door
== fix.oj-d3store-door.sign
- The crew store door sticks and needs a shove to open.
== fix.oj-d3store-door.done
- It swings open at a touch. Orla will like that.
// Replace a crew store light
== fix.oj-d3store-light.sign
- A light over the store counter flickers on the ledger.
== fix.oj-d3store-light.done
- Steady light on the counter.
// Ease a sticky booth door
== fix.oj-d3call-door.sign
- A call-home booth door sticks, and closes with a bang.
== fix.oj-d3call-door.done
- It closes softly now. Better for quiet calls.
// Clean a stuffy booth vent
== fix.oj-d3call-vent.sign
- The booth vent barely moves the air. It's stuffy inside.
== fix.oj-d3call-vent.done
- Fresh air in the booth. Long calls will be easier.
// Tighten the booth bench
== fix.oj-d3call-bench.sign
- The bench outside the booths wobbles under anyone waiting.
== fix.oj-d3call-bench.done
- Steady seat for the queue.
// Clean a gym vent
== fix.oj-d3gym-vent.sign
- The gym vent can't keep up. The air is warm and heavy.
== fix.oj-d3gym-vent.done
- A cool draught. Better for everyone on the rowers.
// Stick down a lifting gym mat
== fix.oj-d3gym-mat.sign
- A gym mat's corner lifts every time someone steps on it.
== fix.oj-d3gym-mat.done
- Flat and stuck down. No more tripping.
// Tighten a rattling weight rack
== fix.oj-d3gym-rack.sign
- The weight rack rattles every time a weight goes back.
== fix.oj-d3gym-rack.done
- Quiet. The weights sit snug.
// Refix a loose gym mirror
== fix.oj-d3gym-mirror.sign
- A gym mirror shifts on its fixing when the floor shakes.
== fix.oj-d3gym-mirror.done
- Fixed firm. Your reflection holds still.
// Fix the dripping water fountain
== fix.oj-d3gym-fountain.sign
- The water fountain drips steadily into its tray.
== fix.oj-d3gym-fountain.done
- Not a drip. Nandakumar would approve.
// Unstick a gym locker
== fix.oj-d3gym-locker.sign
- A gym locker door is stuck shut. Someone's towel is in there.
== fix.oj-d3gym-locker.done
- The door opens. The towel's free.
// Unblock a garden drip line
== fix.oj-d3garden-drip.sign
- One drip line in the garden has stopped dripping; the soil beneath is pale and dry.
== fix.oj-d3garden-drip.done
- Drip, drip, drip. The bed darkens as you watch.
// Refix a leaning trellis
== fix.oj-d3garden-trellis.sign
- A trellis leans over, and the beans on it lean with it.
== fix.oj-d3garden-trellis.done
- Upright again. The beans look relieved.
// Clear a clogged tray drain
== fix.oj-d3garden-drain.sign
- Water sits in a grow tray because its drain is clogged with roots.
== fix.oj-d3garden-drain.done
- The tray drains clear.
// Replace a grow light tube
== fix.oj-d3garden-light.sign
- A grow light tube flickers pink over the seedlings.
== fix.oj-d3garden-light.done
- An even glow. The seedlings will love it.
// Clean the garden air vent
== fix.oj-d3garden-vent.sign
- The garden air vent is furred with fluff from the seed heads.
== fix.oj-d3garden-vent.done
- Clean vent. The leaves stir in the breeze again.
// Fix a leaking hose joint
== fix.oj-d3garden-hose.sign
- A hose joint sprays a fine mist sideways onto the path.
== fix.oj-d3garden-hose.done
- A dry joint. The path stays dry too.
// Free a stuck bed curtain
== fix.oj-d3inf-curtain.sign
- A bed curtain in the infirmary is stuck on its rail.
== fix.oj-d3inf-curtain.done
- It glides all the way round.
// Oil a squeaking bed wheel
== fix.oj-d3inf-wheel.sign
- An infirmary bed wheel squeaks every time it moves.
== fix.oj-d3inf-wheel.done
- Rolls without a sound.
// Clean the waiting room vent
== fix.oj-d3inf-vent.sign
- The waiting room vent is clogged, and the room feels close.
== fix.oj-d3inf-vent.done
- Fresh air in the waiting room.
// Clear a slow washroom drain
== fix.oj-d3wash-drain.sign
- A washroom basin holds a pool of grey water.
== fix.oj-d3wash-drain.done
- Down it goes, with a satisfying gulp.
// Clean the washroom extractor grille
== fix.oj-d3wash-vent.sign
- The washroom extractor grille is clogged; the room stays steamy.
== fix.oj-d3wash-vent.done
- The steam clears quickly now.
// Fix a cubicle door that will not latch
== fix.oj-d3wash-door.sign
- A cubicle door swings open on its own. The latch won't catch.
== fix.oj-d3wash-door.done
- Click. It latches properly. Everyone's relieved.
// ---- Deck 4: the junior wing
// Clean the lift lobby vent
== fix.oj-d4lobby-vent.sign
- The junior wing lobby vent is grey with lint from the laundry.
== fix.oj-d4lobby-vent.done
- Clean vent. The lobby smells of nothing in particular.
// Tighten a wobbly lobby bench
== fix.oj-d4lobby-bench.sign
- The lobby bench creaks and leans when two sit on it.
== fix.oj-d4lobby-bench.done
- Two can sit, or three. Not a creak.
// Tidy the notice board
== fix.oj-d4lobby-board.sign
- The notice board is a jumble of old notes and loose pins.
== fix.oj-d4lobby-board.done
- Tidy rows. Last week's notes are down; this week's are easy to read.
// Refit a rattling wall panel
== fix.oj-d4lobby-panel.sign
- A wall panel in the lobby rattles when the lift arrives.
== fix.oj-d4lobby-panel.done
- The lift comes and goes. The panel stays quiet.
// Oil a squeaky corridor door
== fix.oj-d4corr-hinge.sign
- A corridor door in the junior wing groans like it's tired.
== fix.oj-d4corr-hinge.done
- It opens quietly. The night shift will thank you.
// Clean a corridor ceiling vent
== fix.oj-d4corr-vent.sign
- A corridor ceiling vent drips a little condensation.
== fix.oj-d4corr-vent.done
- Dry and clear. No more drips on heads.
// Fix a lifting floor strip
== fix.oj-d4corr-strip.sign
- A floor strip in the corridor has lifted at one end.
== fix.oj-d4corr-strip.done
- Flush with the floor. Nothing to catch a toe.
// Clean the common room vent
== fix.oj-d4common-vent.sign
- The common room vent hums and blows dust over the Tiles board.
== fix.oj-d4common-vent.done
- Quiet air. The Tiles board stays clean.
// Fix a sagging common room sofa
== fix.oj-d4common-sofa.sign
- The common room sofa dips in the middle. Whoever sits there ends up in a heap.
== fix.oj-d4common-sofa.done
- Firm all along. Room for three.
// Reset the common room screen
== fix.oj-d4common-screen.sign
- The common room screen shows nothing but a blue square.
== fix.oj-d4common-screen.done
- The picture's back. Film night is saved.
// Level the games table
== fix.oj-d4common-table.sign
- The games table rocks, and the Tiles slide about.
== fix.oj-d4common-table.done
- Level. Rina will have no excuses now.
// Unstick a cupboard door
== fix.oj-d4common-cup.sign
- A common room cupboard door is jammed. The board games are inside.
== fix.oj-d4common-cup.done
- It opens. The games tumble out, all present.
// Clear the dryer lint trap
== fix.oj-d4laundry-lint.sign
- The dryer's lint trap is packed thick with fluff.
== fix.oj-d4laundry-lint.done
- Clean trap. The dryer roars happily.
// Clear the laundry sink drain
== fix.oj-d4laundry-drain.sign
- The laundry sink drains slowly, burping bubbles back up.
== fix.oj-d4laundry-drain.done
- The sink empties in one go.
// Oil the music room door
== fix.oj-d4music-door.sign
- The music room door squeaks on the open and the close.
== fix.oj-d4music-door.done
- Silent door. Only the music makes noise in here now.
// Tighten a floppy music stand
== fix.oj-d4music-stand.sign
- A music stand droops whenever anyone puts music on it.
== fix.oj-d4music-stand.done
- Upright and firm. The music stays put.
// Clear a slow basin drain
== fix.oj-d4port-drain.sign
- A basin in the port washroom is slow to empty.
== fix.oj-d4port-drain.done
- The basin clears straight away.
// Clean the washroom extractor grille
== fix.oj-d4port-vent.sign
- The port washroom extractor rattles and barely pulls.
== fix.oj-d4port-vent.done
- It pulls steady and quiet.
// Refix a loose towel hook
== fix.oj-d4port-hook.sign
- A towel hook by the showers hangs loose by one screw.
== fix.oj-d4port-hook.done
- Firm hook. Towels stay off the floor.
// Clear a slow basin drain
== fix.oj-d4stbd-drain.sign
- The starboard washroom basin keeps a puddle in its bowl.
== fix.oj-d4stbd-drain.done
- Empty bowl, every time.
// Clean a fogged mirror
== fix.oj-d4stbd-mirror.sign
- The mirror by the starboard showers is fogged and streaked.
== fix.oj-d4stbd-mirror.done
- Clear mirror. It stays clear after a shower now.
// Refix a loose towel hook
== fix.oj-d4stbd-hook.sign
- A towel hook on the starboard side swings round when touched.
== fix.oj-d4stbd-hook.done
- Fixed straight. It holds a wet towel fine.
// ---- Deck 5: Operations
// Clean the lift lobby vent
== fix.oj-d5lobby-vent.sign
- The lobby vent outside Works is dark with fine metal dust.
== fix.oj-d5lobby-vent.done
- Bright slats. The lobby air is clear.
// Polish the deck sign by the lift
== fix.oj-d5lobby-sign.sign
- The deck sign outside Works is smeared with oily prints.
== fix.oj-d5lobby-sign.done
- A clean, bright sign. Calder will notice. She won't say.
// Oil a squeaky corridor hatch
== fix.oj-d5corr-hinge.sign
- A corridor hatch squeals when it swings open.
== fix.oj-d5corr-hinge.done
- It swings without a whisper.
// Clean a corridor ceiling vent
== fix.oj-d5corr-vent.sign
- A corridor vent near the bay rattles a loose slat.
== fix.oj-d5corr-vent.done
- Every slat sits tight.
// Fix a lifting floor strip
== fix.oj-d5corr-strip.sign
- A floor strip near the bay is lifting and catches cart wheels.
== fix.oj-d5corr-strip.done
- Flat strip. The carts roll right over.
// Free a stuck cargo latch
== fix.oj-d5hold-latch.sign
- A cargo latch in the hold won't release.
== fix.oj-d5hold-latch.done
- The latch swings free. The crate can come out.
// Re-tension a cargo strap
== fix.oj-d5hold-strap.sign
- A cargo strap has gone slack round a stack of crates.
== fix.oj-d5hold-strap.done
- Tight strap. The crates won't shift.
// Grease the cart bay guide rail
== fix.oj-d5cart-rail.sign
- The cart bay guide rail is dry, and the carts judder along it.
== fix.oj-d5cart-rail.done
- Greased rail. The carts glide.
// Replace a cart bay light
== fix.oj-d5cart-light.sign
- A cart bay light has gone dark over the charging spot.
== fix.oj-d5cart-light.done
- The bay's bright again.
// Descale the tea corner kettle
== fix.oj-d5tea-kettle.sign
- The tea corner kettle is furred white inside and takes ages to boil.
== fix.oj-d5tea-kettle.done
- A clean kettle, boiling in half the time. Halloran will be thrilled.
// Clear a slow basin drain
== fix.oj-d5wash-drain.sign
- A Works washroom basin is slow, and grey with soap.
== fix.oj-d5wash-drain.done
- Clean basin, quick drain.
// Clean the washroom extractor grille
== fix.oj-d5wash-vent.sign
- The Works washroom grille is caked with dust.
== fix.oj-d5wash-vent.done
- The grille's clean. The air moves.
// Unstick the time clock card slot
== fix.oj-d5bay-clock.sign
- The time clock's card slot is jammed. Someone's card is stuck halfway in.
== fix.oj-d5bay-clock.done
- The card pops out. The slot takes the next one cleanly.
// ---- Deck 6: Engineering
// Clean the lift lobby vent
== fix.oj-d6lobby-vent.sign
- The engineering lobby vent hums with the coils and blows warm dust.
== fix.oj-d6lobby-vent.done
- Clean vent. Just the coils humming now.
// Tighten a lobby bench
== fix.oj-d6lobby-bench.sign
- The bench by the engineering lift has a wobble.
== fix.oj-d6lobby-bench.done
- Steady bench.
// Oil a stiff inspection hatch
== fix.oj-d6lobby-hatch.sign
- An inspection hatch by the lift is stiff and grinds when it opens.
== fix.oj-d6lobby-hatch.done
- It opens smooth and easy.
// Replace a lobby light
== fix.oj-d6lobby-light.sign
- A light in the engineering lobby has died.
== fix.oj-d6lobby-light.done
- The lobby is bright again.
// ---- the rec deck
// Clean the lift lobby vent
== fix.oj-d7lobby-vent.sign
- The rec deck lobby vent smells faintly of pool water.
== fix.oj-d7lobby-vent.done
- Fresh air. Only a hint of the pool now.
// Clean a concourse vent
== fix.oj-d7conc-vent.sign
- A concourse vent is clogged with fluff from the beanbags.
== fix.oj-d7conc-vent.done
- The vent breathes. The beanbags shed elsewhere.
// Skim the pool gutter
== fix.oj-d7pool-drain.sign
- Leaves and fluff have collected in the pool gutter.
== fix.oj-d7pool-drain.done
- A clean gutter. The water runs clear.
// Tighten a pool ladder
== fix.oj-d7pool-ladder.sign
- A pool ladder shifts when anyone climbs out.
== fix.oj-d7pool-ladder.done
- Firm rungs. Out you climb.
// Oil a stiff lounger hinge
== fix.oj-d7pool-lounger.sign
- A lounger's backrest is stiff and won't lie back.
== fix.oj-d7pool-lounger.done
- It lies back easily. Very relaxing.
// Clean a river hall vent
== fix.oj-d7river-vent.sign
- A river hall vent is damp and drips onto the pebbles.
== fix.oj-d7river-vent.done
- Dry vent. The pebbles stay dry.
// Tighten a spinning climbing hold
== fix.oj-d7river-hold.sign
- A climbing hold on the wall spins when grabbed. Not ideal.
== fix.oj-d7river-hold.done
- Tight hold. It doesn't move an inch. Tomas will be glad.
// Tighten a loose dock board
== fix.oj-d7river-dock.sign
- A dock board knocks when anyone steps on it.
== fix.oj-d7river-dock.done
- Quiet board. The kayaks can launch in peace.
// Oil the sim bay door
== fix.oj-d7sim-door.sign
- The sim bay door grinds as it slides.
== fix.oj-d7sim-door.done
- It slides open with a soft hiss.
// Clean the sim bay vent
== fix.oj-d7sim-vent.sign
- The sim bay vent struggles, and the room is warm.
== fix.oj-d7sim-vent.done
- Cool air. The sim bay is comfortable again.
// Fix a stuck tip-up seat in the stands
== fix.oj-d7stand-seat.sign
- A tip-up seat in the stands is stuck folded up.
== fix.oj-d7stand-seat.done
- It folds down for sitting and up for leaving.
// Fix a squeaky auditorium seat
== fix.oj-d7aud-seat.sign
- An auditorium seat squeaks every time someone shifts.
== fix.oj-d7aud-seat.done
- Silent seat. Talks will be quieter now.
// Clean an auditorium vent
== fix.oj-d7aud-vent.sign
- An auditorium vent rattles during the quiet bits.
== fix.oj-d7aud-vent.done
- Silent vent. The quiet bits are quiet.
// Refit a loose court wall panel
== fix.oj-d7disc-panel.sign
- A court wall panel rattles each time the disc hits it.
== fix.oj-d7disc-panel.done
- Firm panel. The disc bounces clean.
// Clean the float room vent
== fix.oj-d7float-vent.sign
- The float room vent is clogged; the air feels thick.
== fix.oj-d7float-vent.done
